                <head>Agreements between the United States and Spain respecting air transport
                    services, amending the agreement of December 2, 1944</head>
                <p>[Effected by exchange of <hi rendition="#italic">notes verbales</hi> dated at
                    Madrid December 21, 1945, and January 15, 1946 (Department of State, Treaties
                    and Other International Acts Series No. 2131, or 62 Stat. (pt. 3) 4078), and
                    exchange of <hi rendition="#italic">notes verbales</hi> dated at Madrid February
                    21 and March 12, 1946 (Treaties and Other International Acts Series No. 2132, or
                    62 Stat, (pt.3) 4081).]</p>
